<title>USA: SanDisk sees lower litigation costs.</title>
<headline>SanDisk sees lower litigation costs.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SanDisk Corp said high litigation costs were significant during the third quarter, but are expected to decline.</p>
<p>&quot;While litigation costs will remain significant, we project these costs to decline during the current quarter,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The litigation relates to SanDisk's action against Samsung Semiconductor. SanDisk expects a decision from the International Trade Commission during the third quarter.</p>
</text>
